Package: opectools
Type: Package
Title: Reusable Analysis Workflows for Entomological Surveillance Data
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Peter Chukwunwendu", "Okeke", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "your.email@example.com"),
    person("Opec Research Consult", role = c("cph", "fnd")))
Description: Configurable, reproducible workflows for analysing mosquito and
    other arthropod catch data: data standardisation and quality control,
    descriptive summaries and diversity indices, count regression models
    (Poisson, negative binomial, COM-Poisson and zero-inflated mixed models via
    glmmTMB) with offsets for sampling effort, simulation-based residual
    diagnostics (DHARMa), estimated marginal means and contrasts, climate
    correlations and lagged associations with disease incidence, and
    publication-ready figures. Study-specific
    decisions live in a YAML configuration file rather than in the code.
